    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32504" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ollārĭus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		olla, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging to pots</i>, <i>pot-</i> (post-Aug.), <i><span class="en">Plin. 34, 9,
				20, § 98</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">‡ fusor,</span>”
				<i>a pot-founder</i>, <i>pot caster</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Inscr. Grut. 630, 9</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: ‡ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ollārĭ-um</span></b> ,
				ĭi, n., <i>the
				receptacle for the jars of ashes in tombs</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Inscr. Fabr. p. 13</span></i>, n. 60; cf.
			Fabr. p. 10 sq.</div>
